            "verseId": "1SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi batabani ba Eli bakaba bari abantu abataine mugasho, abatarikumanya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nigwo gwabaire guri omucwe gw'abo banyamurwa omu mitwarize yaabo n'abantu. Omuntu weena ku yaabaire atamba ekitambo, omuheereza w'omunyamurwa aija bakiteekire enyama, aine orwoma rw'amaino ashatu omu ngaro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arucumita omu safuriya, nari omu binika, nari omu nyungu, nari omu rwabya; ekintu kyona eki orwoma rwabaire rujaburamu, nikyo omunyamurwa yaabaire atwara. Okwo nikwo baabaire batwaza Abaisraeli boona abaabaire baza Shiilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ebishaju ku byabaire biba bitakookiibwe, omuheereza w'omunyamurwa akaba aija, agira orikutamba ati: Mpa enyama y'okwokyeza omunyamurwa; ahabw'okuba tarikwenda eteekire, kureka embisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ogwo muntu akimugarukamu ati: Ka babanze bootsye ebishaju, obone kutwara ei orikwenda yoona, onu amugarukamu ati: Ngaaha! gimpe hati; kandi ku oraayangye, ningitwaza amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.2.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 2:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okwo nikwo ekibi ky'abo batsigazi kyabaire kihango omu maisho ga MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba bikareetera abantu kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo babitamirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
