              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugirira ati: N'ekya buzima nkaba ngizire nti; Ab'enju yaawe n'ab'enju ya sho nibo bariguma nibaheereza omu maisho gangye ebiro byona; mbwenu hati MUKAMA naagira ati: Nikikabure! ahakuba abarikumpa ekitiinisa, nibo ndikiha; kwonka abarikungaya, baryagaywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reeba, ebiro nibiija, obu ndimaraho amaani gaawe n'ag'enju ya sho, hakabura omugurusi omu nju yaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu kubonabona kwawe oryareebesa eihari ebirungi byona ebi Abaisraeli bariheebwa omu Butaaho bwangye; n'omu nju yaawe tiharibamu mugurusi ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku harigira omuntu waawe owaahonokaho, akatsigara aha itambiro ryangye, aryaba ow'okukuhwereza amaisho noorira, n'okukusaasa omutima; oruzaaro rw'enju yaawe rwona ruryahenderwa omunyeeto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
