                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima weena oriba yaatsigaireho omu nju yaawe, aryaija, amukwate amaguru ngu amuhe akacweka k'efeeza nari omugaati, amushabe ati: Ninkweshengyereza, mpa omurimo gumwe aha y'abanyamurwa, beitu nkaabona ak'okurya.",
